How to Use Qloo-vibe
​Open the Live App: Click on the live web link provided in the submission. The app opens instantly in any browser—no installation needed!
​Tab 1: Input
​Type in any seed entity (e.g., an artist, movie, or brand).
​Select a category (Music, Movies, Fashion, Dining, or Travel) and target audience.
​Adjust the sliders and click to analyze.
​Tab 2: Output
​Explore all 10 advanced cultural intelligence features, including the 3D Taste Graph, AI Persona card, Radar Chart, and Vibe Preview Player.
​Toggle between the 15 languages using the menu to instantly translate the entire app.
​Tab 3: Save Favorites
​Bookmark your top cultural matches or non-favorites to keep them organized.
